  <description>In this episode of the Caminandes cartoon series we get to know our hero
 Koro even better! It's winter in Patagonia, food is getting scarce. 
Koro the Llama engages with Oti the pesky penguin in an epic fight over 
that last tasty berry.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This short 'Free Culture' animation film 
was made with the free 3D software Blender and funded by the subscribers
 of the Blender Cloud platform. Already since 2007, Blender Institute 
successfully combines film and media production with improving a free 
and open source 3D creation pipeline.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Currently a lot of extra material and tutorials is being produced, to share the full production with the cloud subscribers.</description>
